Package: STSCKM
Type: Project
Title: Graph-Regularized K-Means for Spatio-Temporal and Multi-View Data
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: person("Muh Akbar", "Idris", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-2995-1975"))
Description: Python implementation of graph-regularized K-means for
    spatio-temporal and multi-view data, including a domain-general estimator,
    a spatio-temporal specialization, layered sparse graphs, diagnostics,
    parameter search, and reproducible cross-domain examples. This DESCRIPTION
    file is included for journal repository metadata; the implementation is
    Python-based.
